window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Hemlock Cove’s favorite witches can’t seem to keep their noses out of trouble. Not that they’d want to.</p> <p>The weather might be turning cold for the Winchester witches, but Bay and her motley crew of witchy friends are about to heat things up.</p> <p>Trouble is coming for Hemlock Cove. Prepare yourself, because it’s going to be a witchy ride.<br> <br> This three-book omnibus includes Dial W for Witch, White Witchmas, and All Quiet on the Witchy Front.</p>"; 
